Portions of the web UI styling in switchyard/web/ (styles.css, hero.css, tour.css, guide.css, fx.js and the
markup patterns in index.html) are adapted from Faultline's frontend (frontend/src/app/globals.css and its
home page components): the colour tokens (near-black canvas, ember / iris / mint accents), the card, glass,
hairline and gradient-text treatments, the turning-gradient ring chip, the marquee, the "+" registration
marks, the numbers strip, the footer wordmark, the pointer-following card light and the motion curves.

Changes made: rewritten as plain CSS and vanilla JavaScript (no Tailwind, React or framer-motion), a light
theme added, and applied to Switchyard's own markup, content and behaviour. No Faultline product content,
application code or assets are included. Faultline does not ship a NOTICE file of its own.

